            "detailed_description": "<strong>The year is 1967 and you are a TV repair person. Get to work. </strong><br><br>In TV Trouble, you are presented with an endless conveyor belt of faulty TVs. Each TV is a micro-puzzle comprised of dials, button panels and antennae. Tune in and repair as many televisions as you can against the clock. Earn bonus points for speedy and efficient work. <br><br>Gamepad and Keyboard supported.",
