                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Of all dating simulators, this has to be my favorite one ever made. In this game we are given many different choices and options between the love interests that are all equally alluring. I will say, I did find myself a little frustrated (in more ways than one) when it came to the tsundere TVs that kept refusing to be fixed. However, I know a thing or two about making them like it. I would just keep touching every dial and every attenae on these sexy rectangles, and they'd love it so much, they would fix. I will warn everyone, this game can be quite hard to play with one hand but its well worth it. What could be better than a game about so many sexy love interests fighting for your affection?",
